+The coefficient of (u) in the braces in (3.2) is
+
+\[
+ R_1+R_2=-L.                                           \tag{3.3}
+\]
+
+This is exactly the rung-36 trace row. The other coefficient is
+
+\[
+ -cR_1-aR_2,
+\]
